OL,3,GNEWSA'I wanted an ambulance for my 70th
OL,4,A- not a spa day'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman from Kenilworth said her
OL,7,Fbirthday wishes came true when she got
OL,8,Fan ambulance for her 70th birthday.
OL,10,FRather than more jewellery or a spa
OL,11,Fday, Sharon Maxted said she wanted do
OL,12,F"something special" to mark turning 70
OL,13,Fin June and she will now be driving an
OL,14,Fambulance full of medical supplies,
OL,15,Fwarm clothes and a mobility scooter to
OL,16,FUkraine alongside her husband David.
OL,18,FThe pair will set off on Friday driving
OL,19,Fto the east of Poland where they will
OL,20,Fdrop off the ambulance with the
OL,21,Fsupplies and fly back home.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
