OL,3,GNEWSA'I wanted an ambulance for my 70th
OL,4,A- not a spa day'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"My husband said he would only buy me
OL,7,Fone if I agreed to drive it which was a
OL,8,Fbit of a shock to the system and I am a
OL,9,Fbit worried as we have had an automatic
OL,10,Fcar for five years," Sharon said.
